 "assumptions": [
  "butteraugli-original -> butteraugli_original::error_map (butteraugli_original.rs:593-645): sRGB->linear 256-LUT on 3 planes, compute() (509-592) per image pair; images <8x8 pad-extended (implementation, ignored at eval shapes).",
  "Blur kernel radius r = max(1, trunc(2.25*sigma)) (butteraugli_original.rs:65-72), separable h+v convolve; per px per pass: taps mul + taps-1 add + taps load + store. Radii: sigma1.2->r3 (7t), sigma7.47->r16 (33t), sigma3.73->r8 (17t), sigma1.87->r4 (9t), sigma10.67->r24 (49t), sigma9.24->r20 (41t), sigma2.38->r5 (11t), sigma9.04->r20 (41t).",
  "xyb (112-124): 3x blur sigma1.2 + 2 opsin (9mul+9add) + 3x gamma (rational 6/6 Chebyshev pair ~ mul22 add28 div1 + cvt) + v=p*g/s (3mul+3div) + combine (2add).",
  "separate (158-206): 3x blur sigma7.47 (lf) + 3 subs + 3x blur sigma3.73 (mf) + hf-=mf & remove/amplify (2ch) + y-dependent scale (f64: mul3 div1 add3 cvt2) + 2x blur sigma1.87 (hf) + uhf-=hf + remove/clamp + lf-regulated scaling (mul4 div2 add4 cmp3 ch<2) + lf rescale (mul3 add1).",
  "malta x6 (207-249): 4 low-frequency calls (MALTA_LOW 18 paths / 80 neighbour samples) + 2 high (MALTA_HIGH 18 paths / 128 samples); per px: dif (abs2 cvt2 mul1 add3 div2 cmp4 ~ +select) + accumulate (neighbors add + 18 mul + 18 add). LOW accum ~98 ops, HIGH ~146 ops.",
  "noise (388-401): min-cap subtract + blur sigma10.67 + weighted fma. asymmetric (360-387): ~mul4 add4 cmp4. l2 x2 (351-359): sub+fma+mul ~ mul2 add2 per px each.",
  "masks (444-508): 4 mix planes (mul2 add1 cvt2), diffpre x2 (each: 4 sub + 4 abs + min + mul + cmp), 3 blurs (sigma9.24, 2.38, 9.04), per-px: y combine (mul3 add2) + p0/p1 (mul4 add2) + 6 lookups (~ mul1 add2 cmp1 each) + 2 scale muls.",
  "Final combine (580-591): 6 mul + 5 add + cmp + sqrt (or mul if small).",
  "Ops are per-pixel-per-image unless noted; malta/noise/l2/asymmetric/masks/final operate on plane pairs (images=1)."
 ],
